[00:04.75]作曲：Victor Pool/Ruben Den Boer/Erin Beck/Whitney Phillips
[00:05.75]作词：Victor Pool/Ruben Den Boer/Erin Beck/Whitney Phillips
[00:09.75]There's a part of me
{"我内心深处"}
[00:11.80]That's lying underneath
{"潜藏着另一面"}
[00:14.01]That wants to see the darker side
{"渴望窥见黑暗深渊"}
[00:18.64]Nothing I won't try
{"没有什么不敢尝试"}
[00:20.85]Once or maybe twice
{"一次或再来一次"}
[00:23.17]Are you down to take the ride?
{"你可愿与我同行？"}
[00:25.93]
[00:27.03]Living so naive, never going deep
{"活得如此天真 从未深入探寻"}
[00:31.48]Ain't a pill I could swallow, swallow
{"没有能咽下的药丸 咽下"}
[00:35.89]Taking off the edge, all I'm asking is
{"缓解焦躁 我只想问"}
[00:40.29]Will you be there to follow?
{"你是否会追随到底？"}
[00:43.59]So down, hit ground when I'm going low
{"沉沦 坠地当我陷入低谷"}
[00:47.97]Tell me anywhere I go you will follow
{"告诉我无论去哪你都会跟随"}
[00:52.53]Go round, all out when I lose control
{"兜转 失控当我彻底放纵"}
[00:57.02]Tell me anywhere I go you will follow
{"告诉我无论去哪你都会跟随"}
