[01:32.35]Tell me anywhere I go you will follow
{"告诉我无论去哪你都会跟随"}
[01:36.97]
[01:38.35]Don't wanna put this wrong
{"不愿误解这心意"}
[01:40.55]I know I'm coming strong
{"知我攻势太凌厉"}
[01:42.68]But I can't get this off my mind
{"却无法将此念抹去"}
[01:47.01]Imagine you and me
{"幻想你我的故事"}
[01:49.23]Or you and me and she
{"或你我她的纠葛"}
[01:51.55]Where do you go when you run wild?
{"当你放纵时会逃向何方？"}
[01:54.67]
[01:55.76]Living so naive, never going deep
{"活得如此天真 从未深入探寻"}
[02:00.23]Ain't a pill I could swallow, swallow
